        "content": "This dashboard reads from **DriveTrace TimescaleDB** (`drivetrace-timescaledb`).\n\n- If SQL panels load, datasource connectivity is healthy.\n- FIWARE connectivity is validated through API endpoints and `scripts/test-fiware.ps1`.\n- In V1, Grafana does **not** connect directly to Orion-LD.\n- Entity publication status should be interpreted together with the FIWARE monitor page in the application."
